  "content": "<p>Eaton Corporation plc is a multinational power management company that provides energy-efficient solutions to help customers effectively manage electrical, hydraulic, and mechanical power. The company operates through various segments, including Electrical Americas, Electrical Global, Aerospace, and Vehicle, serving diverse markets such as data centers, utilities, industrial, and residential. Eaton is dedicated to improving the quality of life and the environment through the use of power management technologies and services, focusing on sustainability and innovation to address the world's most urgent power management challenges.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Craig%20Arnold\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Craig Arnold</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Craig Arnold is Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Eaton. He was appointed Chairman and CEO on June 1, 2016. Previously, he served as President and Chief Operating Officer of Eaton and as Vice Chairman and Chief Operating Officer of the Industrial Sector. He joined Eaton in 2000 as Senior Vice President and Group Executive of the Fluid Power Group. Prior to Eaton, he held various leadership positions at General Electric.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Olivier%20Leonetti\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Olivier Leonetti</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">February 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Olivier Leonetti is Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of Eaton. He joined Eaton in 2024. Prior to joining Eaton, he served as Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of Johnson Controls International plc from 2020 to 2024. He also served as CFO of Zebra Technologies and Western Digital.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Heath%20Monesmith\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Heath Monesmith</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Operating Officer, Electrical Sector</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Heath Monesmith is President and Chief Operating Officer, Electrical Sector. He was appointed to this role in 2022. Previously, he served as President and Chief Operating Officer, Industrial Sector, and as Executive Vice President and General Counsel.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Paulo%20Ruiz\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Paulo Ruiz</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Operating Officer, Industrial Sector</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Paulo Ruiz is President and Chief Operating Officer, Industrial Sector. He was appointed to this role in 2022. He joined Eaton in 2019 as President of the Hydraulics Group. Prior to Eaton, he spent more than 18 years with Siemens.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ernest%20Marshall%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ernest Marshall, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 2018</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Vice President and Chief Human Resources Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ernest W. Marshall, Jr. is Executive Vice President and Chief Human Resources Officer. He joined Eaton in 2018. Prior to Eaton, he served in various HR leadership roles at GE Aviation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Darryl%20Wilson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Darryl Wilson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Founder, chairman and president of The Wilson Collective. Director since 2022.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Deborah%20McCoy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Deborah McCoy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2000</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Senior Vice President, Flight Operations, Continental Airlines, Inc. She served in this role from 1999 until 2005.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dorothy%20Thompson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dorothy Thompson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Chief Executive Officer of Drax Group plc. She served as CEO from 2005 to 2017.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gerald%20Johnson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gerald Johnson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 23, 2025</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Executive Vice President, Global Manufacturing, General Motors Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gregory%20Page\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gregory Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2003</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Chair of the Board</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of Cargill, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kiran%20Patel\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kiran Patel</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2002</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director (Board of Directors)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Kiran Patel was formerly the Executive Vice President and General Manager of the Small Business Group at Intuit Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Lori%20Ryerkerk\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Lori Ryerkerk</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman, Chief Executive Officer and President of Celanese Corporation since 2019. Previously Executive Vice President of Global Manufacturing, Shell Downstream Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Pagano%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Pagano, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President, Chief Executive Officer and Chairperson of the Board of Watts Water Technologies, Inc. since 2014.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Pragada\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Pragada</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 28, 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Pragada has served as Chief Executive Officer since January 2023 and as a Director since joining the Board in 2022. He previously served as President and Chief Operating Officer from 2019 to 2023. He first joined Jacobs in 2006 and held several executive roles before a brief departure to serve as President and CEO of the Brock Group from 2014 to 2016, returning to Jacobs in 2016.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Silvio%20Napoli\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Silvio Napoli</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Executive Chairman of the Board of Directors of Schindler Holding Ltd. since 2017. He has held various leadership roles at Schindler since 1994.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Craig%20Arnold\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Craig Arnold</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">June 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Eaton since 2016. Joined Eaton in 2000.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Silvio%20Napoli\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Silvio Napoli</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Executive Chairman of the Board of Directors of Schindler Holding Ltd. since 2017. He has held various leadership roles at Schindler since 1994.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Deborah%20McCoy\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Deborah McCoy</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2004</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Senior Vice President, Flight Operations, Continental Airlines, Inc. She served in this role from 1999 until 2005.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gregory%20Page\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gregory Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2003</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Cargill, Incorporated. He served as Executive Chairman from 2013 to 2015 and CEO from 2007 to 2013.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Dorothy%20Thompson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Dorothy Thompson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Retired Chief Executive Officer of Drax Group plc. She served as CEO from 2005 to 2017.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Lori%20Ryerkerk\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Lori Ryerkerk</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman, Chief Executive Officer and President of Celanese Corporation since 2019. Previously Executive Vice President of Global Manufacturing, Shell Downstream Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Pagano%2C%20Jr.\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Pagano, Jr.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President, Chief Executive Officer and Chairperson of the Board of Watts Water Technologies, Inc. since 2014.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Darryl%20Wilson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Darryl Wilson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Founder, chairman and president of The Wilson Collective. Director since 2022.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gerald%20Johnson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gerald Johnson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">July 23, 2025</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Executive Vice President, Global Manufacturing, General Motors Company.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kiran%20Patel\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kiran Patel</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2002</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director (Board of Directors)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Kiran Patel was formerly the Executive Vice President and General Manager of the Small Business Group at Intuit Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Pragada\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Pragada</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 28, 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Pragada has served as Chief Executive Officer since January 2023 and as a Director since joining the Board in 2022. He previously served as President and Chief Operating Officer from 2019 to 2023. He first joined Jacobs in 2006 and held several executive roles before a brief departure to serve as President and CEO of the Brock Group from 2014 to 2016, returning to Jacobs in 2016.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1551182/000155118224000010/etn-20231231.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Eaton Corporation plc 2023 Annual Report on Form 10-K</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-02-23)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1551182/000119312524068567/d539515ddef14a.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Eaton Corporation plc 2024 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-15)</span></li></ul>"
